  "description": "Conversion of dwelling into two flats (2 x 2 beds) with associated boundary treatment",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By reasons of the inadequate combined living/kitchen/dining space in Flat A, the Gross Internal Floorspace for Flat B, and the lack of private outdoor amenity space for Flat B would cumulatively result in sub-standard level of living accommodation for the future occupiers of the proposed dwellings, contrary to Policies D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policies DM1, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), Technical housing standards – nationally described space standard (2015), Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023) and Harrow Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
